From 4e838115206649f0bb0afa2fa3c0e755c38f40c6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ritesh Pandit <riteshp2001@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 15:34:46 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 111/140] feat: integrate CrashX for enhanced crash reporting
 and recovery

- Removed GlobalExceptionHandler and replaced it with CrashX integration.
- Added CrashReportStore for capturing and storing crash reports.
- Introduced DebugLogsActivity for displaying debug logs.
- Updated AboutScreen to include CrashX in open source libraries.
- Enhanced crash screen strings across multiple languages for better user experience.
- Added new strings for crash report preparation and failure messages.
- Updated libs.versions.toml to include CrashX dependency.
